          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Generac and Kohler build closely matched air-cooled standby generators, with near-identical engine size, the same 3,600 rpm, under 5% THD, and five-year base warranties. Generac wins on dealer depth, sizing choice and competitive quotes; Kohler wins on enclosure durability, motor starting and clearer warranty terms.
          </p>
